Z||000000||BC-GT||04-24-2001||09:42 PM||||Ok kids, here's the deal. my bud from Winnipeg is driving out here at the end of May to pick me up for a road trip through the States. We hwve most of the trip planned already but could use some interesting stops/sights along the West coast from Vancouver,BC to Los Angeles. Will be taking the Sony digital camera to capture all the Fieros and other sights. Very nice car, 454 4 speed.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.zing.com/picture/p865e6a34b8255d5e9ff5662c04224735/fe9a4373.jpg.orig.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.zing.com/picture/p259feea12f5cfefd963c53205f6531a2/fe9a42d0.jpg.orig.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.zing.com/picture/p59319b82f3a1789fb5e34f53e82484ee/fe9a40e4.jpg.orig.jpg"> <BR>More pics here <A HREF="http://www.imagestation.com/album/?id=4292729791" TARGET=_blank>http://www.imagestation.com/album/?id=4292729791</A> <BR><P>------------------<BR>Darryl Martin<BR>1985 GT <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.zing.com/picture/pf251a969c96964ef15691e97e7ac4489/feb64e3a.jpg.orig.jpg"> ||||reg||6
